              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "Because *Miraculous: Tales of Ladybug & Cat Noir* has different episode orders depending on the country, streaming platform, and whether you are looking at production vs. broadcast order, **Season 2 Episode 12 has already come out**. \n\nThe exact release date depends on which episode you are referring to:\n\n### 1. **\"Sapotis\"** (Production Order: Episode 212)\nIf you are following the official production order or standard wiki order, Episode 12 is **\"Sapotis\"** (the episode where Alya first receives the Fox Miraculous to become Rena Rouge). \n* **World Premiere (France):** January 21, 2018 (on TF1)\n* **US/International Release:** March 30, 2018 (as part of Netflix's Season 2, Part 1)\n\n### 2. **\"Captain Hardrock\"** (Broadcast Order / TV Trackers)\nOn many TV tracking guides and on Disney Channel US's original broadcast run, Episode 12 of Season 2 is listed as **\"Captain Hardrock\"** (the episode that introduces Luka Couffaine).\n* **World Premiere:** March 30, 2018 (released on Netflix US)\n* **US Television Premiere (Disney Channel):** May 20, 2018\n\n### 3. **\"Gorizilla\"** (Google Play / Apple TV Order)\nOn platforms like Apple TV and Google Play in certain regions, Episode 12 of Season 2 is listed as **\"Gorizilla\"** (the episode where Adrien's bodyguard is akumatized). \n* **World Premiere (Canada):** March 14, 2018 (on Family Channel)\n* **US Television Premiere (Disney Channel):** May 13, 2018",
